{"type":"message","id":"4e626570","parentId":"4b3c1e5c","timestamp":"2026-03-04T05:25:43.730Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me create a coordination plan and start the task. The issue is clear:\n\n1. `cgFile.cpp` includes `<cgns_io.h>` which is from the cgio library\n2. The project links both `cgio` and native CGNS (`cgns`)\n3. There's a symbol conflict - `CGIO::Zone::number_node()` is being called instead of the native CGNS function\n\nThe root cause is in `src/CMakeLists.txt`:\n```cmake\ntarget_link_libraries(${TgtLib} PUBLIC compi cgio)\n```\n\nThis links `cgio` which contains `libcgio.so` that has `CGIO::Zone::number_node()`.\n\nLooking at `cgFile.cpp`:\n```cpp\n#include <cgns_io.h>\n```\n\nThis includes the cgio header, but the code uses native CGNS API like `cg_open`, `cg_zone_read`, etc.\n\nThe fix should be:\n1. Remove `cgio` from the link libraries in `src/CMakeLists.txt`\n2. Remove `#include <cgns_io.h>` from `cgFile.cpp` and `metisCutter.cpp`\n3. Verify the build and tests\n\nLet me spawn a code-agent to handle this fix.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"## 任务分析\n\n**问题根因已确认：**\n\n1. `src/CMakeLists.txt` 第68行链接了 `cgio` 库\n2. `cgFile.cpp` 和 `metisCutter.cpp` 都 include 了 `<cgns_io.h>`\n3. 符号冲突：`CGIO::Zone::number_node()` 被错误调用\n\n**修复方案：**\n- 移除 `cgio` 链接\n- 移除 `<cgns_io.h>` include\n- 验证串行和并行测试\n\n**复杂度评估：Medium**\n- 需要代码修改 + 编译验证 + 计算流体测试\n- Team: code-agent → test-agent"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tool-0d7f0078e2ea46db9397377d264cee5f","name":"write","arguments":{"content":"# Coordination Plan\n\n**Date:** 2026-03-04\n**Task:** 修复 CGNS Mesh Cutter 的 ParMETIS 算法\n**Agent:** leader-agent\n\n## Workspace\n`/home/one/projects/cgnsMeshCutter`\n\n## Complexity Assessment\n- **Level:** Medium\n- **Reasoning:** 需要修复链接问题，验证 ParMETIS 算法，并进行计算流体验证\n\n## Selected Team\n| Agent | Role | Workspace | Status |\n|-------|------|-----------|--------|\n| code-agent | 修复链接问题 | /home/one/projects/cgnsMeshCutter | ⏳ Pending |\n| test-agent | 验证串行/并行测试 | /home/one/projects/cgnsMeshCutter | ⏳ Pending |\n\n## Workflow DAG\n```\ncode-agent → test-agent → done\n     ↑           │\n     └───────────┘ (loop if issues, max 3x)\n```\n\n## Iteration Rules\n| Stage | Exit Criteria | Loop Back | Max Iterations |\n|-------|---------------|-----------|----------------|\n| Code | 编译成功，链接正确 | - | 1 |\n| Test | 串行METIS通过 + 并行ParMETIS通过 | Code | 3 |\n\n## Exit Conditions\n- Loop exits when: 串行 METIS 测试通过 AND 并行 ParMETIS 测试通过\n- Escalate when: 3 iterations without progress\n\n## Problem Analysis\n1. **根因**: `src/CMakeLists.txt` 链接了 `cgio` 库，与原生 CGNS 符号冲突\n2. **修复**: 移除 cgio 链接，移除 `<cgns_io.h>` include\n3. **验证**: \n   - 编译通过\n   - 串行 METIS: `./cutter.exe -t metis -m pipe.cgns -np 2`\n   - 并行 ParMETIS: `mpirun -n 2 ./cutter.exe -t metis -m pipe.cgns -np 2`\n   - 计算流体收敛测试\n\n## Status\n🔄 In Progress","file_path":"/home/one/.openclaw-reports/leader-agent/2026-03-04-task-plan.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"bailian","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":149,"output":1175,"cacheRead":32895,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":34219,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772601899478}}
