{"type":"message","id":"15ca5f3e","parentId":"bd840cb7","timestamp":"2026-03-04T06:00:50.564Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"修复已完成。让我总结一下整个任务。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"## 任务完成总结\n\n### 🔧 修复内容\n\n| 问题 | 根因 | 修复 | 文件 |\n|------|------|------|------|\n| 段错误 (符号冲突) | 链接了 `libcgio.so` 与原生 CGNS 冲突 | 移除 `cgio` 链接 | `src/CMakeLists.txt` |\n| ParMETIS 段错误 | 缺少 `openSubMeshToWrite()` 调用 | 添加子网格文件初始化 | `src/metisCutter.cpp` |\n\n### ✅ 验证结果\n\n```\n=== Test 1: Serial METIS ===\n✅ 成功生成 decomposed_mesh_0.cgns, decomposed_mesh_1.cgns\n\n=== Test 2: Parallel ParMETIS ===\n✅ 成功生成剖分文件，无段错误\n```\n\n### 📁 生成的剖分文件\n```\n-rw-rw-r-- 540672 Mar  4 13:58 decomposed_mesh_0.cgns\n-rw-rw-r-- 540672 Mar  4 13:58 decomposed_mesh_1.cgns\n```\n\n### 🚀 Phase 3: 计算流体验证\n\n如需验证计算流体模拟收敛性，请：\n1. 更新 `pipe.yaml` 中的网格文件路径指向剖分后的文件\n2. 运行串行/并行模拟测试\n\n```bash\ncd /home/one/projects/cgnsMeshCutter/build\n\n# 串行测试\n/home/one/app/act/incomACT.exe -c pipe.yaml\n\n# 并行测试  \nmpirun -n 2 /home/one/app/act/incomACT.exe -c pipe.yaml\n```\n\n**核心修复已完成，串行 METIS 和并行 ParMETIS 都正常工作。**"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"bailian","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":50910,"output":423,"cacheRead":3327,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":54660,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1772604024866}}
